17:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4","children":"Kalkulyatordan qanday foydalanish"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-sm sm:prose-base max-w-none text-muted-foreground space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Kalkulyator qanday ishlaydi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Sayohat narxi kalkulyatori O'zbekiston bo'ylab avtomobil sayohatining xarajatlarini oldindan baholashga yordam beradi. Mamlakatning yo'l tarmog'i 180 000 km dan ortiq yo'llarni o'z ichiga oladi va barcha hududlarni — Toshkentdan Nukusgacha bog'laydi. Kalkulyator yoqilg'i narxini, avtomobil amortizatsiyasini, xizmat xarajatlarini hisobga oladi va avtomobilda sayohatni muqobillar bilan solishtirish imkonini beradi: poyezd, samolyot yoki shaharlararo taksi."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Hisoblash formulasi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Avtomobil sayohati xarajatlarining tarkibi: yoqilg'i umumiy qiymatning 70–80% ini tashkil etadi, avtomobil amortizatsiyasi — taxminan 15–20% (~3 000 so'm/km byudjet Chevrolet Cobalt/Nexia modellari uchun), texnik xizmat — 5–10% (~1 000 so'm/km). Yoqilg'i sarfi haydash uslubi, avtomobil yuklanishi, yo'l holati va tezlik rejimiga sezilarli bog'liq — trassada sarf shaharga qaraganda pastroq."}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Hisoblash misoli"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Toshkent — Buxoro marshruti (600 km) hisob-kitobi: 9 l/100 km sarfda AI-92 benzinda (13 500 so'm/l) yoqilg'i narxi 729 000 so'm, amortizatsiya va xizmat — yana ~240 000 so'm, jami taxminan 969 000 so'm. Metanda xuddi shu sayohat yoqilg'iga ~534 000 so'm tushadi (5 750 so'mdan taxminan 93 m³). Solishtirish uchun: «Afrosiyob» poyezd chiptasi — 400 000 so'mdan, aviabilet — 800 000 so'mdan."}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Nimalarni hisobga olish kerak"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Avtomobilda yo'lovchilar bilan sayohat qilganda bir kishiga narx sezilarli kamayadi. Mashinada 4 kishi bo'lsa, ~969 000 so'mlik xarajatlar to'rtga bo'linadi — har biriga atigi ~242 000 so'm, bu har qanday muqobil transportdan arzon. Bu avtomobil sayohatlarini O'zbekistonning mashhur marshrutlari bo'ylab sayohat qiluvchi oilalar va guruhlar uchun ayniqsa foydali qiladi."}]]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Foydali maslahatlar"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Bizning sayohat narxi kalkulyatorimiz marshrut, avtomobil markasi, yoqilg'i turi va yo'lovchilar sonini kiritish imkonini beradi — va bir zumda xarajatlarning to'liq smetasini olasiz. Natija moddalar bo'yicha taqsimot va jamoat transporti bilan solishtirishni o'z ichiga oladi. Uni ta'til rejalashtirish, ishbilarmonlik safarlari yoki shaharlar orasidagi muntazam marshrutlar uchun ishlating."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 space-y-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Ma'lumotnoma va tariflar"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border","children":"$L1c"}]]]}],"$L1d","$L1e"]}]
